+/-- **Lemma 7.10, A3b roots.** Each of the 116 roots holds for every profile in its domain
+`Ξ(B₁,ₘ, B₁,ₘ′, m, m′, δ)`; each (D) root uniformly over its full `(γ, ω₀)` box. -/
+theorem lemma_7_10_a3b :
+    ∀ r ∈ settledRootsB, Root r.1 r.2.1 r.2.2 :=
+  sorry
